#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
msgid "The error catcher chooses how to render an exception based on `accept` HTTP header.  If it's `text/html` or any unknown content type, it will use the error or exception HTML template to display errors.  For other mime types, the error handler will choose different renderers registered in a renderer provider.  By default, it supports JSON, XML, and plain text."
msgstr "O error catcher escolhe como renderizar uma exceção com base no header HTTP `accept`.  Se ele for `text/html` ou um tipo de conteúdo desconhecido, usa o template HTML de erro ou de exceção para exibir os erros.  Para outros mime types, o error handler escolhe entre os renderers registrados em um renderer provider.  Por padrão, ele suporta JSON, XML e texto puro."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implementing your own renderer"
msgstr "Implementando o seu próprio renderer"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
msgid "You may customize the error response format by implementing `Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ThrowableRendererInterface`.  The renderer converts a throwable into `Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ErrorData`, which contains the response body and headers."
msgstr "Você pode personalizar o formato da resposta de erro implementando `Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ThrowableRendererInterface`.  O renderer converte um throwable em `Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ErrorData`, que contém o corpo e os headers da resposta."

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Throwable;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ErrorData;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ThrowableRendererInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Header;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class MyRenderer implements ThrowableRendererInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function render(Throwable $t, ?ServerRequestInterface $request = null): ErrorData\n"
"    {\n"
"        return new ErrorData(\n"
"            '{\"message\":\"An internal server error occurred.\"}',\n"
"            [Header::CONTENT_TYPE => 'application/problem+json'],\n"
"        );\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function renderVerbose(Throwable $t, ?ServerRequestInterface $request = null): ErrorData\n"
"    {\n"
"        return new ErrorData(\n"
"            json_encode(\n"
"                [\n"
"                    'type' => $t::class,\n"
"                    'message' => $t->getMessage(),\n"
"                    'file' => $t->getFile(),\n"
"                    'line' => $t->getLine(),\n"
"                ],\n"
"                JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR | JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES,\n"
"            ),\n"
"            [Header::CONTENT_TYPE => 'application/problem+json'],\n"
"        );\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Throwable;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ErrorData;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ThrowableRendererInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Header;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class MyRenderer implements ThrowableRendererInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function render(Throwable $t, ?ServerRequestInterface $request = null): ErrorData\n"
"    {\n"
"        return new ErrorData(\n"
"            '{\"message\":\"An internal server error occurred.\"}',\n"
"            [Header::CONTENT_TYPE => 'application/problem+json'],\n"
"        );\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function renderVerbose(Throwable $t, ?ServerRequestInterface $request = null): ErrorData\n"
"    {\n"
"        return new ErrorData(\n"
"            json_encode(\n"
"                [\n"
"                    'type' => $t::class,\n"
"                    'message' => $t->getMessage(),\n"
"                    'file' => $t->getFile(),\n"
"                    'line' => $t->getLine(),\n"
"                ],\n"
"                JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR | JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES,\n"
"            ),\n"
"            [Header::CONTENT_TYPE => 'application/problem+json'],\n"
"        );\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
msgid "Register the renderer in `config/common/di/error-handler.php`:"
msgstr "Registre o renderer em `config/common/di/error-handler.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use App\\Error\\MyRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Definitions\\DynamicReference;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\HtmlRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\JsonRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\PlainTextRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\XmlRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\RendererProvider\\CompositeRendererProvider;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\RendererProvider\\ContentTypeRendererProvider;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\RendererProvider\\HeadRendererProvider;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ThrowableResponseFactory;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ThrowableResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ThrowableResponseFactoryInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => ThrowableResponseFactory::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'rendererProvider' => DynamicReference::to(\n"
"                static fn (ContainerInterface $container) => new CompositeRendererProvider(\n"
"                    new HeadRendererProvider(),\n"
"                    new ContentTypeRendererProvider($container, [\n"
"                        'application/problem+json' => MyRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'application/json' => JsonRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'application/xml' => XmlRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'text/xml' => XmlRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'text/plain' => PlainTextRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'text/html' => HtmlRenderer::class,\n"
"                        '*/*' => HtmlRenderer::class,\n"
"                    ]),\n"
"                ),\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use App\\Error\\MyRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Definitions\\DynamicReference;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\HtmlRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\JsonRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\PlainTextRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\XmlRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\RendererProvider\\CompositeRendererProvider;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\RendererProvider\\ContentTypeRendererProvider;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\RendererProvider\\HeadRendererProvider;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ThrowableResponseFactory;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ThrowableResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ThrowableResponseFactoryInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => ThrowableResponseFactory::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'rendererProvider' => DynamicReference::to(\n"
"                static fn (ContainerInterface $container) => new CompositeRendererProvider(\n"
"                    new HeadRendererProvider(),\n"
"                    new ContentTypeRendererProvider($container, [\n"
"                        'application/problem+json' => MyRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'application/json' => JsonRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'application/xml' => XmlRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'text/xml' => XmlRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'text/plain' => PlainTextRenderer::class,\n"
"                        'text/html' => HtmlRenderer::class,\n"
"                        '*/*' => HtmlRenderer::class,\n"
"                    ]),\n"
"                ),\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
msgid "The `renderers` array maps `Accept` header content types to renderer class names. When you provide this array, it replaces the default map, so include the default renderer classes you still need."
msgstr "O array `renderers` mapeia os tipos de conteúdo do header `Accept` para nomes de classes de renderer. Quando você informa esse array, ele substitui o mapa padrão, então inclua as classes de renderer padrão que ainda precisar."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Friendly exceptions"
msgstr "Exceções amigáveis"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
msgid "Yii error renderer supports [friendly exceptions](https://github.com/yiisoft/friendly-exception) that make error handling an even more pleasant experience for your team. The idea is to offer a readable name and possible solutions to the problem:"
msgstr "O renderer de erros do Yii suporta [exceções amigáveis](https://github.com/yiisoft/friendly-exception), que deixam o tratamento de erros ainda mais agradável para o seu time. A ideia é oferecer um nome legível e possíveis soluções para o problema:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\FriendlyException\\FriendlyExceptionInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class RequestTimeoutException extends \\RuntimeException implements FriendlyExceptionInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function getName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return 'Request timed out';\n"
"    }\n"
"    \n"
"    public function getSolution(): ?string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return <<<'SOLUTION'\n"
"Likely it is a result of resource request is not responding in a timely fashion. Try increasing timeout.\n"
"SOLUTION;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\FriendlyException\\FriendlyExceptionInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class RequestTimeoutException extends \\RuntimeException implements FriendlyExceptionInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function getName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return 'Request timed out';\n"
"    }\n"
"    \n"
"    public function getSolution(): ?string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return <<<'SOLUTION'\n"
"Likely it is a result of resource request is not responding in a timely fashion. Try increasing timeout.\n"
"SOLUTION;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/handling-errors.md
msgid "When the application throws such an exception, the error renderer would display the name and the solution if the debug mode is on."
msgstr "Quando a aplicação lança uma exceção desse tipo, o renderer de erros mostra o nome e a solução se o modo debug estiver ativado."
